<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-AUSTRIA LEAD CROATIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRIA LEAD CROATIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>GRAZ, Austria 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria led Croatia 2-0 in</p>
<p>their European/African zone group one, second round Davis Cup</p>
<p>tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Results (Austrian names first):</p>
<p>Gilbert Schaller beat Goran Ivanisevic 6-3 6-4 6-7 (3-7) 2-6</p>
<p>3-1 - Ivanisevic retired</p>
<p>Thomas Muster beat Sasha Hirszon 6-0 6-4 3-6 6-1</p>
</text>
